    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Eternal Hunt</strong> is a thrilling <strong>pixel art roguelite action game</strong> set in a dark and dynamic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle endless waves of enemies on <strong>randomly generated maps</strong>, unlock powerful spells and abilities, and grow stronger with every run. Each death is not the end, but a step toward mastering your character and building the ultimate build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Unlock devastating combos and evolve your wizard</strong><br>Face off against flying eyes, cursed spheres, and ruthless machines. With each run, discover new upgrades and abilities that suit your unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Survive the dangers of a dark enchanted forest</strong><br>The visual style blends pixel art with a gloomy, immersive atmosphere. Fast-paced action and constant pressure will keep you on edge for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Compete on the global leaderboard</strong><br>Prove yourself by surviving longer and scoring higher than others. Will your name reach the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea7 <strong>Join the development through Steam Early Access</strong><br>Your feedback matters. Eternal Hunt is growing, and you can help shape its future. More enemies, content, and features are coming\u2014with your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Survive. Evolve. Hunt.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Eternal Hunt</strong> is a thrilling <strong>pixel art roguelite action game</strong> set in a dark and dynamic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle endless waves of enemies on <strong>randomly generated maps</strong>, unlock powerful spells and abilities, and grow stronger with every run. Each death is not the end, but a step toward mastering your character and building the ultimate build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Unlock devastating combos and evolve your wizard</strong><br>Face off against flying eyes, cursed spheres, and ruthless machines. With each run, discover new upgrades and abilities that suit your unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Survive the dangers of a dark enchanted forest</strong><br>The visual style blends pixel art with a gloomy, immersive atmosphere. Fast-paced action and constant pressure will keep you on edge for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Compete on the global leaderboard</strong><br>Prove yourself by surviving longer and scoring higher than others. Will your name reach the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea7 <strong>Join the development through Steam Early Access</strong><br>Your feedback matters. Eternal Hunt is growing, and you can help shape its future. More enemies, content, and features are coming\u2014with your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Survive. Evolve. Hunt.</strong></p>",
